    "representation": "Each nonempty archived text line with at least one recognized rune defines one row. Include headings. Remove non-alphabet characters; ignore rows with no recognized runes. No corrections or decryption. LP2-50 contributes zero eligible rows.",
    "procedure": "Total number of rows with a prime sum across all selected pages. One global statistic; per-page counts are descriptive only. Independently permute the full rune multiset within each page, then partition it using that page’s original row lengths. Preserve page counts and every row length, not words or per-row counts.",
    "parameters": "594 eligible rows; 56 declared pages, 55 with runic rows; 999 full-dataset trials; seed 330133; greater-than-or-equal upper tail; plus-one Monte Carlo correction; alpha 0.05.",
