  },
  "outcome": "not-supported",
  "finding": "Observed prime-row count 76; shuffled mean 83.786, range 60–115; 843/999 null totals at least observed. Corrected p=0.844, not below 0.05.",
  "limitations": "Pages, statistic and null are analyst choices motivated by existing prime-sum discussion, not a blind discovery. No correction for earlier or future alternative analyses. Archived boundaries were not visually reverified. This tests only a global excess, not a deficit or individual-row intent. Human review pending.",
  "next_steps": "Review transcription boundaries and null assumptions. Alternative numerical properties or boundaries need declared variants; do not select favorable rows after this test.",
